  "description": "The SCOTT Sweep 20 Wave is the ideal first E‑Bike for city life: easy to use, simple to handle, and designed with a sleek low step-through frame that makes getting on and off effortless. With its clean, modern look, it delivers an elevated everyday riding experience—so seamlessly integrated that you’d hardly know it’s electric.\n\nDelivering a natural and intuitive riding feel, the Sweep 20 Wave is powered by Bosch’s latest rear‑hub drive unit, producing 45Nm of torque and offering smooth, efficient support for moving through the city with ease. Its cleanly integrated 360Wh battery is easily removable and provides range for daily commuting—while the option to add a range extender ensures you’re ready for longer urban journeys.\n\nA front suspension fork helps soften bumps and uneven pavement along your route, adding comfort throughout every ride. Additionally, the adjustable stem allows you to find a riding position that feels comfortable for everyday use. With an SP Connect mount integrated directly into the stem, you’ll have a secure spot for your smartphone, keeping navigation and notifications within easy view.\n\nIts versatile 9‑speed drivetrain offers the gearing you need for typical city terrain, from relaxed boulevards to steeper neighborhood streets. For daily practicality, the Sweep 20 Wave comes equipped with a Racktime rear rack to carry your essentials, strong fenders to protect you from splashes and grime, and front and rear lights that help keep you visible and illuminate your route.\n\nWith its streamlined design, lightweight feeling, and easy-to-throw-your-leg-on low step-through frame, the Sweep 20 Wave delivers a smooth, easy riding experience throughout the city—and looks just as good as it feels on the road.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
